## 1. 编译

```bash
bash cmp.sh
```

## 2. 运行

用命令行指令控制运行哪些 task

```bash
./search_opt 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9
```

```bash
Available tasks:
1: Example for (r,s,t) = (11,13,17)
2: Search for 4 <= r <= s <= t where r + s >= 14
3: Case of (r,s) = (4,9)
4: Case of (r,s) = (5,8)
5: Case of (r,s) = (6,7)
6: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,7,t), t >= 7
7-1: Case of (r,s,t) = (4,7,t), t >= 70
7-2: Case of (r,s,t) = (4,7,t), 30 <= t <= 69
7-3: Case of (r,s,t) = (4,7,t), t = 17,19,23,25,29
7-4: Case of (r,s,t) = (4,7,t), t = 11,13
8-1: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,6,t), t >= 70
8-2: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,6,t), 30 <= t <= 69
8-3: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,6,t), t = 17,19,23,29
8-4: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,6,t), t = 11,13
8-5: Case of (r,s,t) = (5,6,7)
```


## 3. 结果

例如task 8 的结果会保存在 `output/search_results_task8.txt` 中

